# Generated run artifacts: per-arm configs, logs, run textfiles, rasters, summary CSVs.
# NOTE the trailing-glob form: an earlier version listed only `results/`, which does NOT match
# `results_implicit_between/` etc., so a `git add` of this directory committed ~3 MB of generated
# rasters and logs per corner. Keep this pattern broad.
results*/
*.log
smoke/

# ...but DO keep the recorded reports of a benchmark run (the repo-wide *.txt rule would drop these).
!RESULTS_*.txt
!COMPARISON_*.txt
!MATRIX_*.txt
